(
    title: "Elevator Action",
    developer: Some("Dan Hitchens, Dave Staugas"),
    description: Some("Atari\'s unfinished port of Taito\'s spy platformer: ride the elevators of a high-rise, collecting secret documents and gunning down the agents who burst from doorways, working ever downward toward the getaway car. An August 1984 internal memo put it at 85% done with eight weeks to go, but the crash intervened — the cart surfaced in 2001 and circulates as a convention reproduction."),
